WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.298
The truth is, we often harm

00:00:01.298 --> 00:00:03.071
and disrespect&nbsp;
the ones we love.

00:00:03.071 --> 00:00:06.177
Abuse sneaks up on us 
disguised in unhealthy love.

00:00:06.644 --> 00:00:08.855
Not&nbsp;only can understanding 
unhealthy signs

00:00:08.855 --> 00:00:11.940
help you avoid the rabbit&nbsp;hole 
that leads to unhealthy love,

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.629
but understanding and practicing 
the art&nbsp;of being healthy

00:00:15.629 --> 00:00:18.307
can improve nearly every 
aspect of your life.

00:00:18.307 --> 00:00:20.363
I'm completely convinced

00:00:20.363 --> 00:00:22.815
that while love is an 
instinct and an emotion,

00:00:22.815 --> 00:00:25.306
the ability to love 
better is a skill

00:00:25.306 --> 00:00:27.927
we&nbsp;can all build and 
improve on over time.

